The external memory, fence and semaphore tests that hand a file descriptor
to another process over a Unix socket (SCM_RIGHTS) take the branch every
platform without that takes, and report themselves not supported: a
descriptor that crosses from one process to another is one of the things
the POSIX layer forbids (`design.md` section 17).

